<title>USA: San Diego $18.6 mln COPs repriced by Dillon Read.</title>
<headline>San Diego $18.6 mln COPs repriced by Dillon Read.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon Read &amp; Co said Wednesday it repriced San Diego Unified School District, Calif., certificates of participation. The top yield was 4.65 percent in 2003.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>CERTIFICATES OF PARTICIPATION FOR 1989-91 CAPITAL PROJECTS</p>
<p>RE: $18,645,000*</p>
<p>SERIES OF 1996B FOR PROJECT PHASE XII</p>
<p>SAN DIEGO UNIFIED SCHOOL DISTRICT</p>
<p>PUBLIC SCHOOL BUILDING CORPORATION</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aa		  S&amp;P: AA-</p>
<p>    DATED: 12/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 07/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>07/01/1999		3,410M    4.50  %	  4.15</p>
<p>07/01/2000		3,555M    4.25  %	  4.30</p>
<p>07/01/2001		3,715M    4.40  %	  4.45</p>
<p>07/01/2002		3,890M    4.50  %	  4.55</p>
<p>07/01/2003		4,075M    4.60  %	  4.65</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, November 14, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on December 4, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
<p>Dillon, Read &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>BA Securities, Inc.</p>
<p>WR Lazard, Laidlaw &amp; Luther</p>
<p>Samuel A. Ramirez &amp; Company, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
